---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How AI Veterinary handles data on this website.">
  <article class="wrap narrow hero prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="notice warn">Draft. This page will be completed with the legal entity, contact details and the newsletter provider before launch.</p>
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>The site is static. It sets no cookies and runs no advertising trackers. If usage statistics are collected, a privacy-respecting, cookie-free service is used and only aggregate numbers are kept.</p>
    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe, your email address and whether you are an owner or a veterinary professional are stored by our newsletter provider only to send you the newsletter. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing deletes your address.</p>
    <h2>Health information</h2>
    <p>Nothing you read here is tied to you. We do not ask for or store information about your animals on this website.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:hello@aiveterinary.org">hello@aiveterinary.org</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
